<!doctype html><html><head><title>Late server actions</title></head><body><main><h1 id="early-content">Server-rendered account page</h1><p>This useful introduction is intentionally long enough to establish an early rollback snapshot before the rest of the server response arrives. It explains the page while preserving ordinary navigation if optional hydration cannot finish.</p><script>document.body.setAttribute('data-early-script','yes')</script><a id="late-link" href="/account">Go</a><script>document.body.innerHTML='<main><p id="loading">Loading application</p></main>';throw new Error('expected hydration failure')</script></main></body></html>
